# Gensokyo Legacy biome port

Original project: https://github.com/Signifier-Dollhouse/GensokyoLegacy
Original author: lcy0x1; subsequent changes by Signifier-Dollhouse contributors.
License: GNU LGPL version 2.1, reproduced in LICENSE.

The resource input is the user-supplied `gensokyolegacy-1.0.7.1-1.20.1.jar`;
`inventory.json` records its SHA-256 and the hashes of every imported file.
The reference checkout is used to understand algorithms, not as an unpinned asset input.

Horizon modifications include registry declarations, namespace rebasing, conversion
of the 1.20 configured-feature codecs, Rust native world-generation algorithms,
and an Overworld regional placement pool compatible with BOP and Tectonic.
The forests preserve the original authored vegetation templates. Pond construction
is adapted to Horizon's bounded generation regions. The original Gensokyo dimension,
characters, quests, houses, entities and integration dependencies are not included.
Minecraft resources are read from the player's prepared game data, not distributed.
